OL,3,GNEWSAPolice and army mourn officer
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice officers and army veterans have
OL,7,Fgathered for the funeral of the second
OL,8,Fofficer killed in a head-on crash.
OL,10,FPC Tom Clough, 38, died on the A66 in
OL,11,FSouth Bank, near Middlesbrough, in the
OL,12,Fearly hours of 22 August alongside his
OL,13,Fcolleague PC Matthew Blades when a
OL,14,FVolkswagen Passat hit their marked
OL,15,Fpolice car. Five young men in the
OL,16,FPassat also died.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
