OL,3,GNEWSAPolice and army mourn officer
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the public also gathered at
OL,7,FKirkleatham Walled Gardens, in Redcar,
OL,8,Ffor the funeral, along with family,
OL,9,Ffriends and former colleagues from the
OL,10,FCivil Nuclear Constabulary in
OL,11,FSellafield, Cumbria.
OL,13,FCleveland Police Federation chair
OL,14,FLauren Somerville said PC Clough's
OL,15,Fpartner had said public support
OL,16,F"brought them so much strength".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
